(984,'Mother India',1957,'Mehboob Khan','A poverty-stricken woman raises her sons through many trials and tribulations. But no matter the struggles, always sticks to her own moral code.',175,ARRAY['Nargis','Sunil Dutt','Rajendra Kumar','Raaj Kumar','Kanhaiyalal Chaturvedi','Kumkum','Mukri','Sheela Naik']::TEXT[],ARRAY['mother','hunger','bodily disabled person','physical work','rage and hate','pride and vanity','aridity','musical','peasant','interest','field','praise']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AlfM9yLcK1rhv73iNbDiOU9vnnu.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:24:00','2026-01-01 16:24:00'),
(985,'Immortality',1998,'Leong Po-Chih','A vampire in London is searching for the ideal woman to ''redeem'' him.',98,ARRAY['Jude Law','Elina Löwensohn','Timothy Spall','Jack Davenport','Hitler Wong','Kerry Fox','Ashley Artus','Antony Cotton']::TEXT[],ARRAY['sacrifice','vampire','crocodile','inspector','civil engineer','asthma','romance','misdirection','urban gothic']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMxdX8QXWjIZDsZthsN8axFR4ws.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:25:00','2026-01-01 16:25:00'),
(986,'7 Virgins',2005,'Alberto Rodríguez','It is summertime in a blue-collar, marginal district of a city in the South of Spain. Tano, a teenager currently serving a sentence in a juvenile reform center, is given a 48-hour leave to attend his brother’s wedding.',86,ARRAY['Juan José Ballesta','Jesús Carroza','Vicente Romero Sánchez','Alba Rodríguez','Julián Villagrán','Ana Wagener','Maite Sandoval','Manolo Solo']::TEXT[],ARRAY['adolescence','hip-hop','grandparent grandchild relationship','socially deprived family','juvenile prison','concrete slabs building','class','teacher','wedding','suburb','drugs','rebellious youth','celebration','seville','spain']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIGNKsJFfaxIOtxjcLT0uy1HBLU.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:26:00','2026-01-01 16:26:00'),
(987,'Gigantic',1999,'Sebastian Schipper','The Hamburg friends Walter, Ricco and Floyd take each day as it comes between the estates of tower blocks and fast food restaurants. All three are in their early twenties and are dreaming of another life when Floyd suddenly takes a job on a freighter going to Singapore.',80,ARRAY['Frank Giering','Florian Lukas','Antoine Monot Jr.','Julia Hummer','Jochen Nickel','Albert Kitzl','Hannes Hellmann','Gustav Peter Wöhler']::TEXT[],ARRAY['farewell','intensive care','kicker','stetson','friendship','disco','hamburg','germany','road movie','burgers']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfIyk9Tlc4u5NdpWvtSD2jQEqOE.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:27:00','2026-01-01 16:27:00'),
(988,'Clean, Shaven',1995,'Lodge Kerrigan','Peter Winter is a young schizophrenic who is desperately trying to get his daughter back from her adoptive family. He attempts to function in a world that, for him, is filled with strange voices, electrical noise, disconcerting images, and jarringly sudden emotional shifts. During his quest, he runs afoul of the law and an ongoing murder investigation.',79,ARRAY['Peter Greene','Robert Albert','Megan Owen','Jennifer MacDonald','Molly Castelloe','J. Dixon Byrne','Alice Levitt','Eliot Rockett']::TEXT[],ARRAY['schizophrenia','detective','beach','obsession','paranoia','adoption','motel','investigation','daughter','murder','morgue','mental institution','illness','voices','fragmented']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpMXYy0L2GHrIVyDF0HkEiDK1Wd.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:28:00','2026-01-01 16:28:00'),
(989,'The Travelling Players',1975,'Theo Angelopoulos','A traveling theatre troupe tours the Greek countryside from 1939 to the early 1950s, staging “Golfo the Shepherdess”. As the years pass, its members endure persecution, betrayal, executions, and exile. Their personal stories become entangled with the country’s major historical events, in a seemingly endless cycle of violence and loss.',223,ARRAY['Eva Kotamanidou','Vangelis Kazan','Aliki Georgouli','Kiriakos Katrivanos','Stratos Pahis','Nina Papazaphiropoulou','Giannis Fyrios','Alekos Boubis']::TEXT[],ARRAY['civil war','spy','greece','fascism','artist','election campaign','conflict']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SQKTdfFNoYtwyFCfUm1WQ4dNEe.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:29:00','2026-01-01 16:29:00'),
(990,'Barren Lives',1963,'Nelson Pereira dos Santos','In vivid images, the documentary-like story of a drover and his family in the northern badlands of Brazil during the drought. A family in the search of new hope and destiny.',100,ARRAY['Átila Iório','Maria Ribeiro','Baleia','Gilvan Lima','Genivaldo Lima','Orlando Macedo','Jofre Soares','Arnaldo Chagas']::TEXT[],ARRAY['hunger','socially deprived family','aridity','peasant','teacher','cinema novo']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBb4GiCZul2W6hhV8sbbnBnlhuE.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:30:00','2026-01-01 16:30:00'),
(991,'The Mortal Storm',1940,'Frank Borzage','The Roth family leads a quiet life in a small village in the German Alps during the early 1930s. After the Nazis come to power, the family is divided and Martin Breitner, a family friend, is caught up in the turmoil.',100,ARRAY['Margaret Sullavan','James Stewart','Robert Young','Frank Morgan','Robert Stack','Bonita Granville','Irene Rich','William T. Orr']::TEXT[],ARRAY['germany','austria','professor','nazi','national socialism','national socialist party','antisemitism','nsdap (nazi party)']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPvS7UVrJuCyE5NsiDkW39ABLGX.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:31:00','2026-01-01 16:31:00'),
(992,'The Hi-Lo Country',1998,'Stephen Frears','An intimate story of the enduring bond of friendship between two hard-living men, set against a sweeping backdrop: the American West, post-World War II, in its twilight. Pete and Big Boy are masters of the prairie, but ultimately face trickier terrain: the human heart.',114,ARRAY['Billy Crudup','Woody Harrelson','Penélope Cruz','Patricia Arquette','Cole Hauser','John Diehl','Sam Elliott','Enrique Castillo']::TEXT[],ARRAY['pearl harbor','cowboy','pickup truck','horse riding accident','cattle ranch']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bC63XzaUEWJArFUQFKwUy77lZS.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:32:00','2026-01-01 16:32:00'),
(993,'The Coast Guard',2002,'Kim Ki-duk','A member of Coast Guard Platoon 23, Private Kang monitors a high-infiltration stretch of beach lined with barbed-wire fencing. Driven by the belief that killing a spy is the highest honor, he waits for a chance to prove his worth.',96,ARRAY['Jang Dong-gun','Kim Jung-hak','Park Ji-a','Yoo Hai-jin','Jung Jin','Kim Koo-taek','Kim Kang-woo','Park Yoon-jae']::TEXT[],ARRAY['sibling relationship','rape','sea','loss of loved one','border','mistake','insanity','murder','marine','korean marine']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ezHR68DZeyKgRraAZd3eGCgmIl.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:33:00','2026-01-01 16:33:00'),
(994,'Short Sharp Shock',1998,'Fatih Akin','Gabriel, Bobby and Costa are old friends from Altona, a multicultural hood in Hamburg. Just out of prison, Gabriel wants to turn his back on crime, but the others continue to operate as petty criminals. Friendships are tested as the trio navigate a dark world of mafia bosses and deals gone wrong.',100,ARRAY['Mehmet Kurtuluş','Aleksandar Jovanović','Adam Bousdoukos','Regula Grauwiller','İdil Üner','Ralph Herforth','Oscar Ortega Sánchez','Marc Hosemann']::TEXT[],ARRAY['foreigner','street gang','ex-boyfriend','ex-girlfriend','immigration','arms deal','friendship','german-turkish living together','wedding','drugs','hoodlum','hamburg','germany']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVyYb5REN5cX5CWAr7wcdu7cT4Y.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:34:00','2026-01-01 16:34:00'),
(995,'Man of Iron',1981,'Andrzej Wajda','In Warsaw in 1980, the Communist Party sends disgruntled radio reporter Winkel to Gdańsk to dig up dirt on the shipyard strikers - particularly on Maciek Tomczyk, an independent labour union leader whose father was killed in the December 1970 protests. Posing as sympathetic, Winkel interviews the people surrounding Tomczyk, including his detained wife, Agnieszka.',147,ARRAY['Jerzy Radziwiłowicz','Krystyna Janda','Marian Opania','Irena Byrska','Wiesława Kosmalska','Bogusław Linda','Franciszek Trzeciak','Janusz Gajos']::TEXT[],ARRAY['individual','strike']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22wNUqKyz2m6wzAt31f26H8Y433.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:35:00','2026-01-01 16:35:00'),
(996,'Princesses',2005,'Fernando León de Aranoa','Caye is a young prostitute whose family is unaware of her profession. She meets her striking Dominican neighbour Zulema, an illegal immigrant, after she finds her in the bathroom, badly beaten up. They strike up a close friendship unbeknownst to Caye''s xenophobic co-workers.',113,ARRAY['Candela Peña','Micaela Nevárez','Mariana Cordero','Llum Barrera','Violeta Pérez','Mònica van Campen','Flora Álvarez','María Ballesteros']::TEXT[],ARRAY['prostitute','rape','aids','madrid','spain','depression','solidarity','immigration','empowerment','strong woman','future','hope','red-light district','stay permit','punter']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMW8v2uhR8pwKXoxa10nq8U3pGD.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:36:00','2026-01-01 16:36:00'),
(997,'Walk on Water',2004,'Eytan Fox','Eyal, an Israeli Mossad agent, is given the mission to track down and kill the very old Alfred Himmelman, an ex-Nazi officer, who might still be alive. Pretending to be a tourist guide, he befriends his grandson Axel, in Israel to visit his sister Pia. The two men set out on a tour of the country, during which Axel challenges Eyal''s values.',103,ARRAY['Lior Ashkenazi','Knut Berger','Caroline Peters','Gideon Shemer','Carola Regnier','Hanns Zischler','Ernest Lenart']::TEXT[],ARRAY['berlin','germany','neo-nazism','israel','homophobia','chauffeur','nazi','mossad','jerusalem','gay club','palestinian-israeli conflict','dead sea','antisemitism','kibbutz','suicide mission']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVWFN3RaBFLuJRtRLPebatX9qPq.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:37:00','2026-01-01 16:37:00'),
(998,'Man of Marble',1977,'Andrzej Wajda','A young Polish filmmaker sets out to find out what happened to Mateusz Birkut, a bricklayer who became a propaganda hero in the 1950s but later fell out of favor and disappeared.',153,ARRAY['Krystyna Janda','Jerzy Radziwiłowicz','Tadeusz Łomnicki','Jacek Lomnicki','Michał Tarkowski','Piotr Cieślak','Wiesław Wójcik','Krystyna Zachwatowicz']::TEXT[],ARRAY['individual','hero','poland','archive footage','bricklayer','communism']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQWfBHQmdQbcUAeyr0VS1j19uto.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:38:00','2026-01-01 16:38:00'),
(999,'Mambo Italiano',2003,'Émile Gaudreault','When an Italian man comes out of the closet, it affects both his life and his crazy family.',89,ARRAY['Luke Kirby','Ginette Reno','Paul Sorvino','Mary Walsh','Peter Miller','Claudia Ferri','Sophie Lorain','Tim Post']::TEXT[],ARRAY['italian american','lovesickness','italian','parent child relationship','canada','new love','coming out','based on play or musical','family','family feud','lgbt','emigrant','gay theme']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/siYFoZUq0HOCksnOc7me8YT1AOo.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:39:00','2026-01-01 16:39:00'),
(1000,'The Rapture',1991,'Michael Tolkin','A lonely telephone operator leading an empty, amoral life finds God – only to have her faith continually tested in ways beyond what she could have imagined.',100,ARRAY['Mimi Rogers','David Duchovny','Patrick Bauchau','Kimberly Cullum','Will Patton','Terri Hanauer','Dick Anthony Williams','James Le Gros']::TEXT[],ARRAY['eroticism','group sex','bible','religion and supernatural','faith','the rapture','religious conversion','end of the world','apocalypse','armageddon','religious fundamentalism','independent film','biblical']::TEXT[],'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EkFm13ecqO0eszr7OKT8vf1YjJ.jpg',NULL,'2026-01-01 16:40:00','2026-01-01 16:40:00');
